---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
    <main class="pt-20">
        <section class="py-24 bg-white">
            <div class="container max-w-4xl">
                <!-- Page Header -->
                <h1
                    class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4 leading-tight uppercase"
                >
                    Privacy <span class="text-primary">Policy</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-secondary/60 mb-12">
                    Last Updated: January 2026
                </p>

                <!-- Content -->
                <div
                    class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-secondary/80 space-y-8"
                >
                    <p>
                        Kentwood Homes ("we," "us," or "our") respects your
                        privacy and is committed to protecting the personal
                        information you provide through this website. This
                        Privacy Policy outlines how information is collected,
                        used, disclosed, and safeguarded in accordance with
                        applicable Canadian privacy legislation, including the <em
                            >Personal Information Protection and Electronic
                            Documents Act (PIPEDA)</em
                        > and applicable provincial laws.
                    </p>

                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4">
                            Collection of Information
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            We may collect personal information that you
                            voluntarily provide, including but not limited to
                            your name, email address, telephone number, and
                            mailing address, when you submit inquiries, register
                            for updates, or otherwise interact with this
                            website.
                        </p>
                        <p class="mt-4">
                            We may also automatically collect non-identifiable
                            information such as IP addresses, browser type,
                            device information, and usage data for
                            administrative, security, and analytical purposes.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4">
                            Use of Information
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            Personal information is used solely for purposes
                            related to responding to inquiries, providing
                            information about Kentwood Homes' projects and
                            services, administering website functions, and
                            complying with legal and regulatory obligations.
                        </p>
                        <p class="mt-4">We do not sell personal information.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4">
                            Disclosure of Information
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            Personal information may be disclosed to third-party
                            service providers who assist with website
                            operations, marketing, analytics, or communications,
                            provided such parties are bound by confidentiality
                            and privacy obligations. Disclosure may also occur
                            where required or permitted by law.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4">
                            Cookies and Tracking Technologies
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            This website may use cookies and similar
                            technologies to enhance functionality, analyze usage
                            patterns, and improve user experience. Cookies do
                            not typically collect personal information. Users
                            may choose to disable cookies through their browser
                            settings; however, doing so may limit certain
                            features or functionality of the website.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4">
                            Data Security
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            We employ reasonable administrative, technical, and
                            physical safeguards to protect personal information
                            against loss, theft, unauthorized access,
                            disclosure, or misuse. While efforts are made to
                            protect personal information, no method of
                            transmission over the Internet or electronic storage
                            is completely secure, and Kentwood Homes cannot
                            guarantee absolute security of personal information.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4">
                            Third-Party Websites
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            This website may contain links to third-party
                            websites. Kentwood Homes is not responsible for the
                            content, privacy practices, or security of any
                            third-party websites. Access to external websites is
                            at your own risk and you are encouraged to review
                            their privacy policies.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4">
                            Retention of Information
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            Personal information is retained only for as long as
                            necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it was
                            collected, or as required by applicable law.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4">
                            Changes to This Privacy Policy
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            Kentwood Homes reserves the right to modify this
                            Privacy Policy at any time without prior notice. Any
                            changes will be effective upon posting to this
                            website. Continued use of the website constitutes
                            acceptance of the revised Privacy Policy.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4">
                            Contact
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            Questions, concerns, or requests regarding this
                            Privacy Policy or our handling of personal
                            information may be directed to:
                        </p>
                        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4 space-y-2">
                            <li>
                                Email: <a
                                    href="mailto:info@kentwoodhomes.ca"
                                    class="text-primary hover:underline"
                                    >info@kentwoodhomes.ca</a
                                >
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Phone: <a
                                    href="tel:+17783089911"
                                    class="text-primary hover:underline"
                                    >778.308.9911</a>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Mail: 1030 – 8477 Bridgeport Road, Richmond, BC
                                V6X 0S8 Canada
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>
